[{"answer":"Yesterday I went to a birthday party.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/1.mp3"},{"answer":"My friend Jane had her tenth birthday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Her house was decorated with balloons and streamers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Her mother had baked a big birthday cake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/4.mp3"},{"answer":"The cake had \"Happy tenth birthday Jane\" written on it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/5.mp3"},{"answer":"There were ten candles on the cake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Jane blew out the candles and made a wish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder what she wished for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Your wish won't come true if you tell anyone what it was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/9.mp3"},{"answer":"We sang \"Happy birthday to you\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/10.mp3"},{"answer":"At the party we played some games.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I won one of the games so I got a prize.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/12.mp3"},{"answer":"We also swam in Jane's swimming pool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Jane opened her gifts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Her gifts were wrapped in bright paper and bows.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/15.mp3"},{"answer":"She got lots of nice gifts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/16.mp3"},{"answer":"She got some compact discs, some clothes and some computer games.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Jane thanked everyone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/18.mp3"},{"answer":"We ate a lot of food at Jane's party.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/19.mp3"},{"answer":"We had hot dogs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I put mustard and ketchup on my hot dog.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we ate cake and ice cream.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/22.mp3"},{"answer":"We had pop to drink.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I had too much cake and ice cream.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I was very full by the time the party was over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/25.mp3"},{"answer":"We thanked Jane and her mother before we all went home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/26.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a very good party.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone had a good time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope Jane had a happy tenth birthday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/68-the-birthday-party-2019-03-29-12-44-32/29.mp3"}]
